Begin Object Class=/Script/Engine.Blueprint Name="BP_VelocityPlayerController"
   Begin Object Class=/Script/Engine.EdGraph Name="UserConstructionScript"
   End Object
   Begin Object Class=/Script/Engine.EdGraph Name="EventGraph"
   End Object
   ParentClass=/Script/VELOCITYX.VelocityPlayerController
End Object

/*
================================================================================
VELOCITY X - Blueprint Class: BP_VelocityPlayerController
Asset Path: /Game/Blueprints/Input/BP_VelocityPlayerController
Target Parent: AVelocityPlayerController (AVELOCITYXPlayerController)
Description:
   Main Player Controller for VELOCITY X:
   - Full Enhanced Input System Integration with IMC_Driving context
   - Analog Gamepad controls (Triggers for Throttle/Brake, Stick for Steering)
   - Dynamic Haptic Vibration on Handbrake and Collision Crashes
   - 4-Mode Camera Cycling (Chase -> Hood -> Cockpit -> Top)
   - Car Reset & Un-flip mechanics
   - Pause Game Menu toggle with bExecuteWhenPaused = true
   - Optional fine mouse steering assist
================================================================================

CLASS DEFAULTS CONFIGURATION:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- PlayerCameraManagerClass: BP_CameraManager
- InputConfig: DA_VelocityInputConfig
- Gamepad Settings:
    * SteeringDeadzone: 0.05
    * SteeringSensitivity: 1.0
    * TriggerDeadzone: 0.02
    * bEnableGamepadVibration: true
    * HandbrakeRumbleIntensity: 0.65
- Mouse Assist:
    * bEnableMouseSteeringAssist: false
    * MouseSteeringSensitivity: 0.015
    * MouseSteeringAutoCenterRate: 4.0

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
INPUT ACTIONS MAPPING:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
- IA_Throttle -> HandleEnhancedThrottle / HandleEnhancedThrottleCompleted
- IA_Brake    -> HandleEnhancedBrake / HandleEnhancedBrakeCompleted
- IA_Steer    -> HandleEnhancedSteer / HandleEnhancedSteerCompleted
- IA_Handbrake-> HandleEnhancedHandbrake / HandleEnhancedHandbrakeCompleted
- IA_CycleCamera -> CycleCamera
- IA_ToggleHeadlights -> ToggleHeadlights
- IA_ResetCar -> ResetCar
- IA_Pause    -> TogglePause (bExecuteWhenPaused = true)
- IA_MouseSteer -> HandleEnhancedMouseSteer

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CORE EVENT GRAPH FLOWS:
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Event BeginPlay:
    1. Retrieve EnhancedInputLocalPlayerSubsystem from LocalPlayer.
    2. AddMappingContext(IMC_Driving, Priority 0).
    3. UpdateCameraManagerReference (link with BP_CameraManager).

Event Tick(DeltaTime):
    1. ProcessVehicleInputs:
       - Combine Digital WASD/Arrows and Analog Gamepad Triggers.
       - Apply Deadzones and interpolate Steering.
       - Send final inputs to CurrentVehicle->ApplyInput(Throttle, Brake, Steer, Handbrake).
    2. If Handbrake pressed AND Vehicle Speed > 5 MPH:
       - PlayHandbrakeHaptics(DeltaTime);
       - Else StopAllHaptics().

Function ResetCar():
    1. Get CurrentVehicle.
    2. Zero out Pitch and Roll, maintain Yaw.
    3. Lift vehicle Z by 60cm to prevent obstacle clipping.
    4. Call CurrentVehicle->ResetVehicle() & Clear velocities.
    5. Call VelocityCameraManager->ResetCamera().
    6. TriggerCrashHaptics(1.5).

Function TogglePause():
    1. bPaused = !bPaused.
    2. SetPause(bPaused).
    3. If bPaused:
           SetInputMode(FInputModeGameAndUI), bShowMouseCursor = true.
       Else:
           SetInputMode(FInputModeGameOnly), bShowMouseCursor = false.
    4. Notify GameMode->SetGameState(Paused / Racing).
================================================================================
*/
